    },
    {
      "occurrence": 3,
      "number": 100,
      "number_raw": "100",
      "source_number": "100",
      "audio": "",
      "source_audio": "",
      "text": "You see a Member of the Children of the Cathedral.",
      "source_text": "You see a Member of the Children of the Cathedral.",
      "source_line_start": 4,
      "source_line_end": 4,
      "number_occurrence": 1,
      "number_occurrence_count": 2,
      "effective": false
    },
    {
      "occurrence": 4,
      "number": 100,
      "number_raw": "100",
      "source_number": "100",
      "audio": "",
      "source_audio": "",
      "text": "你看见一个大教堂的教徒。",
      "source_text": "你看见一个大教堂的教徒。",
      "source_line_start": 5,
      "source_line_end": 5,
      "number_occurrence": 2,
      "number_occurrence_count": 2,
      "effective": true
    },
    {
      "occurrence": 5,
      "number": 101,
      "number_raw": "101",
      "source_number": "101",
      "audio": "",
      "source_audio": "",
      "text": "I do not speak with heathen souls such as yourself.",
      "source_text": "I do not speak with heathen souls such as yourself.",
      "source_line_start": 6,
      "source_line_end": 6,
      "number_occurrence": 1,
      "number_occurrence_count": 2,
      "effective": false
    },
    {
      "occurrence": 6,
      "number": 101,
      "number_raw": "101",
      "source_number": "101",
      "audio": "",
      "source_audio": "",
      "text": "我不和异教的人说话，比如说你。",
      "source_text": "我不和异教的人说话，比如说你。",
      "source_line_start": 7,
      "source_line_end": 7,
      "number_occurrence": 2,
      "number_occurrence_count": 2,
      "effective": true
    },
    {
      "occurrence": 7,
      "number": 102,
      "number_raw": "102",
      "source_number": "102",
      "audio": "",
      "source_audio": "",
      "text": "Your report, VanHagan.",
      "source_text": "Your report, VanHagan.",
      "source_line_start": 8,
      "source_line_end": 8,
      "number_occurrence": 1,
      "number_occurrence_count": 2,
      "effective": false
    },
    {
      "occurrence": 8,
      "number": 102,
      "number_raw": "102",
      "source_number": "102",
      "audio": "",
      "source_audio": "",
      "text": "你的报告，范·海根。",
      "source_text": "你的报告，范·海根。",
      "source_line_start": 9,
      "source_line_end": 9,
      "number_occurrence": 2,
      "number_occurrence_count": 2,
      "effective": true
    },
    {
      "occurrence": 9,
      "number": 103,
      "number_raw": "103",
      "source_number": "103",
      "audio": "",
      "source_audio": "",
      "text": "The Master is pleased with your progress, but his need is great and time is limited.",
      "source_text": "The Master is pleased with your progress, but his need is great and time is limited.",
      "source_line_start": 10,
      "source_line_end": 10,
      "number_occurrence": 1,
      "number_occurrence_count": 2,
      "effective": false
    },
    {
      "occurrence": 10,
      "number": 103,
      "number_raw": "103",
      "source_number": "103",
      "audio": "",
      "source_audio": "",
      "text": "主教对于你的进展很满意，但他的需求很大，给你的时间也很有限。",
      "source_text": "主教对于你的进展很满意，但他的需求很大，给你的时间也很有限。",
      "source_line_start": 11,
      "source_line_end": 11,
      "number_occurrence": 2,
      "number_occurrence_count": 2,
      "effective": true
    },
    {
      "occurrence": 11,
      "number": 104,
      "number_raw": "104",
      "source_number": "104",
      "audio": "",
      "source_audio": "",
      "text": "The Master should know that raw material is limited. We cannot create our soldiers without more stock.",
      "source_text": "The Master should know that raw material is limited. We cannot create our soldiers without more stock.",
      "source_line_start": 12,
      "source_line_end": 12,
      "number_occurrence": 1,
      "number_occurrence_count": 2,
      "effective": false
    },
    {
      "occurrence": 12,
      "number": 104,
      "number_raw": "104",
      "source_number": "104",
      "audio": "",
      "source_audio": "",
      "text": "主教应该知道原料已经不多了，如果没有原料我们就不能制造我们的战士。",
      "source_text": "主教应该知道原料已经不多了，如果没有原料我们就不能制造我们的战士。",
      "source_line_start": 13,
      "source_line_end": 13,
      "number_occurrence": 2,
      "number_occurrence_count": 2,
      "effective": true
    },
    {
      "occurrence": 13,
      "number": 105,
      "number_raw": "105",
      "source_number": "105",
      "audio": "",
      "source_audio": "",
      "text": "He is aware of your problems. He is working on it, as we speak.",
      "source_text": "He is aware of your problems. He is working on it, as we speak.",
      "source_line_start": 14,
      "source_line_end": 14,
      "number_occurrence": 1,
      "number_occurrence_count": 2,
      "effective": false
    },
    {
      "occurrence": 14,
      "number": 105,
      "number_raw": "105",
      "source_number": "105",
      "audio": "",
      "source_audio": "",
      "text": "他意识到了你说的问题。他正在做这个，正像我们说的。",
      "source_text": "他意识到了你说的问题。他正在做这个，正像我们说的。",
      "source_line_start": 15,
      "source_line_end": 15,
      "number_occurrence": 2,
      "number_occurrence_count": 2,
      "effective": true
    },
    {
      "occurrence": 15,
      "number": 106,
      "number_raw": "106",
      "source_number": "106",
      "audio": "",
      "source_audio": "",
      "text": "Tell me of his plans. We will need to coordinate activities, if the Unity is to succeed.",
      "source_text": "Tell me of his plans. We will need to coordinate activities, if the Unity is to succeed.",
      "source_line_start": 16,
      "source_line_end": 16,
      "number_occurrence": 1,
      "number_occurrence_count": 2,
      "effective": false
    },
    {
      "occurrence": 16,
      "number": 106,
      "number_raw": "106",
      "source_number": "106",
      "audio": "",
      "source_audio": "",
      "text": "告诉我他的计划，我们必须配合行动，“同一”事业才能取得成功。",
      "source_text": "告诉我他的计划，我们必须配合行动，“同一”事业才能取得成功。",
      "source_line_start": 17,
      "source_line_end": 17,
      "number_occurrence": 2,
      "number_occurrence_count": 2,
      "effective": true
    },
    {
      "occurrence": 17,
      "number": 107,
      "number_raw": "107",
      "source_number": "107",
      "audio": "",
      "source_audio": "",
      "text": "The Master has become aware of an undiscovered, and living, Vault. With that much raw material, we can create a great force. According to the prediction software, it will be the numbers we need to succeed.",
      "source_text": "The Master has become aware of an undiscovered, and living, Vault. With that much raw material, we can create a great force. According to the prediction software, it will be the numbers we need to succeed.",
      "source_line_start": 18,
      "source_line_end": 18,
      "number_occurrence": 1,
      "number_occurrence_count": 2,
      "effective": false
    },
    {
      "occurrence": 18,
      "number": 107,
      "number_raw": "107",
      "source_number": "107",
      "audio": "",
      "source_audio": "",
      "text": "主教觉察到一个运转良好并且不为人知的避难所。那里有很多的原料，我们可以建立一支庞大的军队。按照软件预测，那里的原料数量足够我们取得胜利。",
      "source_text": "主教觉察到一个运转良好并且不为人知的避难所。那里有很多的原料，我们可以建立一支庞大的军队。按照软件预测，那里的原料数量足够我们取得胜利。",
      "source_line_start": 19,
      "source_line_end": 19,
      "number_occurrence": 2,
      "number_occurrence_count": 2,
      "effective": true
    },
    {
      "occurrence": 19,
      "number": 108,
      "number_raw": "108",
      "source_number": "108",
      "audio": "",
      "source_audio": "",
      "text": "Excellent. This is most fortuitous. Are the inhabitants contaminated?",
      "source_text": "Excellent. This is most fortuitous. Are the inhabitants contaminated?",
      "source_line_start": 20,
      "source_line_end": 20,
      "number_occurrence": 1,
      "number_occurrence_count": 2,
      "effective": false
    },
    {
      "occurrence": 20,
      "number": 108,
      "number_raw": "108",
      "source_number": "108",
      "audio": "",
      "source_audio": "",
      "text": "太棒了。真是幸运。居民们都被污染了吗？",
      "source_text": "太棒了。真是幸运。居民们都被污染了吗？",
      "source_line_start": 21,
      "source_line_end": 21,
      "number_occurrence": 2,
      "number_occurrence_count": 2,
      "effective": true
    },
    {
      "occurrence": 21,
      "number": 109,
      "number_raw": "109",
      "source_number": "109",
      "audio": "",
      "source_audio": "",
      "text": "Oh, this is the best part. If their representative is any example, they are clean. Pure-strain.",
      "source_text": "Oh, this is the best part. If their representative is any example, they are clean. Pure-strain.",
      "source_line_start": 22,
      "source_line_end": 22,
      "number_occurrence": 1,
      "number_occurrence_count": 2,
      "effective": false
    },
    {
      "occurrence": 22,
      "number": 109,
      "number_raw": "109",
      "source_number": "109",
      "audio": "",
      "source_audio": "",
      "text": "哦，这才是最令人高兴的地方。如果那里居民中的样品是典型的，那他们真的是干净的，纯种的。",
      "source_text": "哦，这才是最令人高兴的地方。如果那里居民中的样品是典型的，那他们真的是干净的，纯种的。",
      "source_line_start": 23,
      "source_line_end": 23,
      "number_occurrence": 2,
      "number_occurrence_count": 2,
      "effective": true
    },
    {
      "occurrence": 23,
      "number": 110,
      "number_raw": "110",
      "source_number": "110",
      "audio": "",
      "source_audio": "",
      "text": "Oh, this is most exciting. What Vault is it that we plunder?",
      "source_text": "Oh, this is most exciting. What Vault is it that we plunder?",
      "source_line_start": 24,
      "source_line_end": 24,
